description:
Functions like this are difficult to debug

```r
.data <- object$estimates |>
  purrr::map(
    ~ {
      if (is.null(.x$filter)) {
        new_data <- .data
      } else {
        new_data <- dplyr::filter(.data, !!.x$filter)
      }
      preds <- predict(.x$estimate, newdata = new_data, type = "response")
      preds <- 1 - preds
      lvls <- nm_levels(object$levels)
      new_data[lvls[1]] <- preds
      new_data[lvls[2]] <- 1 - preds
      new_data
    }
  )
```
